            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Your ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": "phase bolt",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": true,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " temporarily sends the target's cover out of phase if it hits. On a success, reduce the target's circumstance bonus to AC (if any) by 1 until the beginning of your next turn. Your ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": "phase bolt",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": true,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " also gains the following amp.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Amp",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " Your bolt leaves phase completely, becoming invisible and intangible until it's already embedded in the target— giving the impression it simply teleported itself into place. The target is ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "flat-footed",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "condition/flat-footed"
        },
        {
          "content": " against the attack. Additionally, the bolt ignores an amount of Hardness or resistance to piercing damage equal to half the spell's level. On a critical success, the target can't be affected by ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "teleportation",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "trait/teleportation"
        },
        {
          "content": " effects until the start of your next turn.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Amp Heightened (+1)",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " The bolt's damage increases by 2d4 instead of 1d4.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Warp Step",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "You warp space more compactly, granting you a +10-foot status to your Speed instead of a +5-foot status bonus when you ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": "warp step",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": true,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": ". The spell also gains the following amp.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Amp",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " Space contracts with hardly a thought, letting you Cast the Spell as a single action.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Amp Heightened (4th)",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " You twist space so completely you don't need to travel the interposing distance. You can choose to instead teleport to a space within your line of sight and line of effect with a range equal to your double your Speed (after applying the status bonus from ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": "warp step",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": true,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": "). This grants the spell the ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "teleportation",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "trait/teleportation"
        },
        {
          "content": " trait.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
